{"term":{"label":"禮","occurrences":12,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii","title":"離婁下","description":"孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"三","id":"三"},{"form":"先","id":"先"},{"form":"又","id":"又"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"從","id":"從"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"必","id":"必"},{"form":"思","id":"思"},{"form":"服","id":"服"},{"form":"欲","id":"欲"},{"form":"相","id":"相"},{"form":"禮","id":"禮"},{"form":"自","id":"自"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"言","id":"言"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"相","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"相","target":"言"},{"weight":2.515678308454754,"source":"思","target":"三"},{"weight":2.2925347571405443,"source":"自","target":"欲"},{"weight":2.3333567516607996,"source":"自","target":"反"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"自","target":"必"},{"weight":0.8109302162163288,"source":"自","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.580216829592325,"source":"又","target":"先"},{"weight":2.803360380906535,"source":"又","target":"從"},{"weight":1.791759469228055,"source":"又","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"服","target":"君"},{"weight":1.0986122886681098,"source":"服","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"服","target":"心"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"source":"必","target":"言"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"source":"必","target":"行"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"必","target":"反"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"source":"必","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.5040773967762742,"source":"從","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.2925347571405443,"source":"從","target":"欲"},{"weight":2.2925347571405443,"source":"從","target":"先"},{"weight":0.49247648509779424,"source":"言","target":"行"},{"weight":0.49247648509779424,"source":"言","target":"禮"},{"weight":0.49247648509779424,"so